Godot Engine v4.7.2.stable.official.ed1daf0bf - https://godotengine.org

  ok gates resolve their exact shifts from the data file
  ok daylight heat is automatic; night heat is a player choice
  ok an unplanned gate has no plan (no hidden default)
  ok DAY shifts reject a heat choice
  ok PUMP/STACK/WAIT are rejected outside shift 5
  ok shift 5 has no ordinary transfer
  ok illegal light and air values are rejected
  ok a partly planned shift names the missing choice
  ok a complete shift becomes the exact simulation step
  ok a committed shift is read-only
  ok STACK forces COOL, air maker OFF and light OFF
  ok STACK's forced settings cannot be overridden
  ok Kai and Amara's cards arrive at shift 1
  ok a card that has not arrived reveals no future facts
  ok an unarrived card cannot be shared
  ok Mission Table commit waits for shared cards
  ok sharing is recorded once; a repeat is a no-op
  ok Rafi's card arrives at shift 2 and Mei's at shift 3
  ok H1-H3 are the canonical hint ladder in order
  ok H3 unlocks the worked Bloom plan
  ok Golden hints stay locked before a first Bloom
  ok G1/G2 unlock after a first Bloom
  ok G2 unlocks the worked Golden plan
  ok the built-in default plan is gone from the route
  ok an unplanned shift refuses to commit and names the missing choice
  ok bloom: every gate's Mission Table forecast equals its committed state
  ok bloom witness ends exactly {"A":1.0,"C":3.0,"E":2.0,"H":1.0,"K":0.0,"R":3.6,"W":0.0,"Z":2.0} (got {"A":1.0,"C":3.0,"E":2.0,"H":1.0,"K":0.0,"R":3.6,"W":0.0,"Z":2.0})
  ok bloom witness reaches BLOOM with no blackout
  ok golden: every gate's Mission Table forecast equals its committed state
  ok golden witness ends exactly {"A":1.0,"C":9.0,"E":0.0,"H":5.0,"K":0.0,"R":3.6,"W":0.0,"Z":2.0} (got {"A":1.0,"C":9.0,"E":0.0,"H":5.0,"K":0.0,"R":3.6,"W":0.0,"Z":2.0})
  ok golden witness reaches GOLDEN with no blackout
  ok pump: every gate's Mission Table forecast equals its committed state
  ok pump witness ends exactly {"A":1.0,"C":7.0,"E":0.0,"H":1.0,"K":0.0,"R":3.6,"W":6.0,"Z":2.0} (got {"A":1.0,"C":7.0,"E":0.0,"H":1.0,"K":0.0,"R":3.6,"W":6.0,"Z":2.0})
  ok pump witness reaches BLOOM with no blackout
  ok stack: every gate's Mission Table forecast equals its committed state
  ok stack witness ends exactly {"A":3.0,"C":6.0,"E":0.0,"H":1.0,"K":0.0,"R":3.6,"W":0.0,"Z":2.0} (got {"A":3.0,"C":6.0,"E":0.0,"H":1.0,"K":0.0,"R":3.6,"W":0.0,"Z":2.0})
  ok stack witness reaches BLOOM with no blackout
  ok demand of exactly the stored 3 ends at E0 with no blackout
  ok exactly E0 applies only breathing and the light change, no blackout penalty
  ok demand of 4 against 3 (E would be −1) is a blackout and clamps E to 0
  ok the −1 blackout applies A−2, H−2 and C−2 before breathing and light
  ok an E0 shift keeps the no-blackout star
  ok H0 with a safe crew is ALO_LOST and does not unlock Chapter 2
  ok A<=0 stops the mission with an air cause
  ok three stars with H4 is BLOOM, not GOLDEN
  ok three stars with H5 is GOLDEN
  ok an earlier blackout removes the star and Golden
  ok an unshielded WAIT exceeds Z3 in shift 6 and flight rules stop the mission
  ok a stopped mission never unlocks Chapter 2
  ok retry restores the shift-5 checkpoint and keeps the written plan
  ok PUMP must be run before its commit
  ok a task step needs a started task
  ok valves must be confirmed in order
  ok a repeated valve confirmation counts once
  ok a partial PUMP moves only +1
  ok three valves move the full +2 and the preview recalculates
  ok switching response is exclusive and clears the other task's progress
  ok a partial STACK gives K1, leaves W alone and forces COOL/OFF
  ok WAIT adds no shelter; S2 gives dose 2
  ok a timed STACK reports its 30-second limit; assisted mode has none
  ok the Mission Table plan, shares and hints survive a JSON save and reload
  ok an invalid saved plan is rejected without changing the live route
  ok an older save without a plan resumes with an empty table, not an invented plan
  ok Commit is disabled with a visible reason until cards are shared
  ok Space cannot commit an unready plan
  ok Commit requires a preview of the current plan
  ok the preview shows the exact shift-1 forecast: E15, A7, 2 lost to overflow
  ok changing the plan invalidates the old preview
  ok every Mission Table button is at least 44 px tall []
  ok Space opens the confirmation without committing
  ok Space again confirms once, emits the table's plan and closes
  ok a duplicate confirm emits nothing
  ok the panel itself never commits resources
  ok large text scales Mission Table controls to 150%
